OL,3,GNEWSAWarehouse firm acts after noise
OL,4,Acomplaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FA warehouse operator in Wigan will stop
OL,7,Ftransport operations overnight after
OL,8,Fresidents campaigned over noise.
OL,10,FLogistics firm Whistl said it will
OL,11,F"cease nighttime transport operations"
OL,12,Fat PLP Astley from 7 September after a
OL,13,Fcampaign by Astley Warehouses Action
OL,14,Fover the "horrendous" noise of lorries
OL,15,Fmoving around the site.
OL,17,FThe announcement came after the firm
OL,18,Fmet campaigners and Greater Manchester
OL,19,FMayor Bev Craig last week.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
