OL,3,GNEWSAWarehouse firm acts after noise
OL,4,Acomplaints
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The processing of mail and parcels
OL,7,Fwill continue within the depot and we
OL,8,Fwill adjust our transport operations to
OL,9,Fensure that we meet our commitments to
OL,10,FWhistl customers," the firm said.
